    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Load the knowledge files and the 013 orchestrator code; declare RIGOR FULL, tier opus, effort high.</step>
    <step order="2">Approve stage (013's hook): no Work Item marker → `IActionSeam.CreateTaskAsync` (owner = owning team, regarding = request, subject = fixed text + request number); store the task id; run AwaitingApproval, request stage "Awaiting approval". `Guid.Empty` TaskId → hold with admin attention.</step>
    <step order="3">Write `IntakeApprovalAuthorizationFilter` (constraints ADR-003/034) and `IntakeApprovalEndpoints` mapping `POST /api/intake/runs/{runId:guid}/decision`; register it in `EndpointMappingExtensions.cs`.</step>
    <step order="4">`IntakeApprovalService`: claim / approve / reject as the criteria state; approve captures each output's SPE version id, writes the Decision Record, enqueues Return and completes the Work Item; reject closes the run (not Failed) and completes the Work Item.</step>
    <step order="5">Persist approved version ids in 013's run state for Return; state writes go last, after the Decision Record.</step>
    <step order="6">Tests for every criterion; build and test; measure the publish-size delta.</step>
    <step order="7">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status cell to `✅ [done]`.</step>
    <step order="8">Document deviations (e.g. where approved versions are stored) in projects/spaarke-intake-pipeline-r1/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If no canonical team-membership read exists that can answer "is the caller a member of team X" fail-closed, STOP and escalate (root CLAUDE.md §6, security-sensitive) rather than writing a new membership mechanism.</trigger>
    <trigger>If task 011/013 provide no run field for the approved version ids or the Work Item marker, STOP and escalate rather than adding a Dataverse column here (schema belongs to 011).</trigger>
    <trigger>If `DecisionRecordWriter` cannot take an intake decision without a new record kind or schema change, STOP and present the options (ADR-040 conflict, root CLAUDE.md §6.5).</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <justification>
    <existing>notes/reuse-scan.md row 4: `IActionSeam.CreateTaskAsync` (:44) and `DecisionRecordWriter` (SignalsModule.cs:70) reused; the only approve endpoints are domain-bound (`InvoiceApprovalEndpoints.cs:58`). CAPABILITY-INDEX: no generic approve row.</existing>
    <extension>Partly: seam and writer reused as-is; `InvoiceApprovalEndpoints` is invoice-specific and frozen until eBilling UAT.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Runs needing approval stay in AwaitingApproval forever; FR-11, FR-13(b) and Return never happen.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

  <tools>
